laysinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470490/extras/1923525ac69605480676c2660a77b9e9.poster.avif?t=1750279614\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470490/extras/1923525ac69605480676c2660a77b9e9.webm?t=1750279614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470490/extras/1923525ac69605480676c2660a77b9e9.mp4?t=1750279614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are never alone</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch out! Guards are always patrolling the corridors, and the greatest advances are often guarded by more powerful enemies with supernatural abilities of their own. It is encounters such as these that truly test the skill and knowledge of players.</p>",
