        "notes": "This game explores themes of mental illness, featuring characters who are patients in an insane asylum. While there is no graphic violence, combat, or gore, the story contains psychologically intense and potentially disturbing content.\r\n\r\nMental health is depicted in both darkly humorous and unsettling ways, and the setting involves elements of confinement, delusion, and trauma. Players may encounter scenes or dialogue that reflect disordered thinking, hallucinations, or emotionally charged situations.\r\n\r\nThe game does not include depictions of sexual acts, sexual violence, or substance abuse."
